==Changes==
{{Subject changes header}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 12 August 2026
|update = Summer Sweep Up - Agility & Chambers of Xeric Changes
|change = Significantly adjusted the weighting of uniques obtained from the raid:
*Normal Mode: Reduced the total weight value from 69 to 60, and the weighting of both the arcane and dexterous prayer scrolls' weighting reduced from 20 to 14, resulting in scrolls being ~19.5% less common.
*Challenge Mode: Reduced total weight value from 69 to 56. The weighting of prayer scrolls is reduced from 20 to 12, resulting in scrolls being ~26.1% less common.
*Both modes: The weighting of ancestral pieces increased from 3 to 4.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date=26 June 2025
|type=hotfix
|change = Seeds are no longer guaranteed drops, instead 33% chance of getting seeds instead of herbs, following the same intended ratio of seeds to herbs.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 25 June 2025
|update = Summer Sweep Up: Combat
|change = Seeds replaced herbs as a reward drop. The amount of herbs that could potentially be rewarded were cut by 20% for all except dwarf weed, which was 40%, and half of that amount would be turned into seed drops at a ratio of 1 seed for every 7 herbs.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 8 January 2025
|update = Run Energy Changes
|change = To prevent megascale boosting abuse at Chambers of Xeric, we've changed how unique rewards are distributed. Now players who leave a raid in progress are eligible to receive unique items, but if they would do so, the reward is discarded instead. This ensures that leaving a CoX raid no longer transfers loot chances onto remaining participants.
}}
{{Subject changes footer}}

